name: ['Alesha, Who Smiles at Death', 'Back to Nature', 'Battlewise Hoplite', 'Darksteel Citadel', 'Elvish Mystic', 'Ensoul Artifact', 'Favored Hoplite', 'Hangarback Walker', 'Kalitas, Traitor of Ghet', 'Mausoleum Wanderer', 'Rally the Ancestors', 'Searing Blood', 'Shadowborn Apostle', 'Siege Rhino', 'Slaughter Games', 'Supreme Verdict', 'Tainted Remedy', 'Temur Battle Rage', 'Tireless Tracker', "Titan's Strength"]
